        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 1665, 2 x 10  Rectangle Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 x 10 Rectangular American Cylinder Below Handle Multi Point Trim  features an American Cylinder Hub below the handle with a 3-5/8 inch center to center. The rustic styling comes from the sandcast process from which it is made. It is this process that creates a pitted look that is idea for modern farmhouse decors. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Rectangular Style Multi Point Trim with American Cylinder Below Handle comes with your choice of trim for an end look that is totally you.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Door-configuration-6-specifcations.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"186\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek Configuation #6 Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Style Multi Point Trim with American Cylinder Below Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn (for Keyed, Passage, and Patio Functions): 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2x10-config-6-specificaion.pdf?v=1704262361\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 1665 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Active (inside):</b> Active lever inside with fixed inactive lever outside. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Inactive:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Patio:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) interior thumb turn and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 x 10 Rectangular American Cylinder Below Handle Multi Point Trim",
                "description": "The 2 x 10 Rectangular American Cylinder Below Handle Multi Point Trim  features an American Cylinder Hub below the handle with a 3-5/8 inch center to center. The rustic styling comes from the sandcast process from which it is made. It is this process that creates a pitted look that is idea for modern farmhouse decors. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Rectangular Style Multi Point Trim with American Cylinder Below Handle comes with your choice of trim for an end look that is totally you.",
